    ieq choice,"1",superstart else goto titlescreen
    ieq choice,"2",Instruct
    ieq choice,"3",finend
    l instruct
    cls
    e ""
    e ""
    e "The goal of this game is to get four of your pieces in a row"
    e "in any direction. To choose a column to place your piece in"
    e "type in the letter that corresponds with it (lowercase only)."
    e "You must stack pieces in each column so the bottom will always"
    e "fill up first. Enjoy! BTW, I do not claim to own Connect Four,"
    e "this is just my representation of it."
    e ""
    e ""
    p
    g :superstart
    l superstart
